// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - ControlAux 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4243041796" "This database contains detailed knowledge about the known powers of super-powered beings, allowing you to better adjust and control your base security system."
// GroupDescription :
"P2569882550" "ControlAux"
// DisplayNames :
"P807756920" "Database"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1554953598" "This terminal monitors many of the functions of base security and increases the control generated by the base computer system."
// DisplayNames :
"P1980593943" "Terminal"
// DisplayNames :
"P2402687719" "Corner Terminal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3575609949" "The Holodisplay provides improved monitoring for base security, increasing the control generated for the base."
// DisplayNames :
"P96566209" "Holodisplay"
// DisplayClassName :
"P3636074017" "Small Device"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2635747514" "Multiple monitors make it easier to observe activity throughout a base. The monitor bank increases control generated for the base."
// DisplayNames :
"P2718105155" "Monitor Bank"
// DisplayNames :
"P1319842271" "Advanced Database"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2777123177" "This advanced terminal can be used to monitor all the functions of base security. It increases the control generated by the base computer system."
// DisplayNames :
"P142811824" "Advanced Terminal"
// DisplayNames :
"P3561994015" "Advanced Corner Terminal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3926631876" "The Edge Holodisplay is a state-of-the-art 3D display for managing base security. It increases the control generated for the base."
// DisplayNames :
"P339359596" "Advanced Holodisplay"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2114491091" "This massive monitor displays all base security information in a single glance. It increases control generated for the base."
// DisplayNames :
"P3322666452" "Mega Monitor"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1670744553" "Information is key to defeating your enemies. This bookshelf generates additional control for your defenses."
// DisplayNames :
"P1661919827" "Bookshelf"
// DisplayDescription :
"P66280785" "From here orders can be sent and plans can be made. This desk increases the amount of control available for your base."
// DisplayNames :
"P3896921441" "Clerk Desk"
// DisplayDescription :
"P275267114" "From here orders can be sent and plans can be made. This table increases the amount of control available for your base."
// DisplayNames :
"P3079277486" "Augury Table"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3511612657" "The advice of spirits from other realms is useful. Their guidance gives you more control for your base."
// DisplayNames :
"P4255131119" "Mystic Advisor"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1459749172" "Through these paintings you can observe events as they unfold, effectively increasing control available in the base."
// DisplayNames :
"P4261012531" "Scrying Paintings"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4242115735" "Information is key to defeating your enemies. These magical texts generate additional control for your defenses."
// DisplayNames :
"P3814757632" "Mystical Bookshelf"
// DisplayNames :
"P4016075530" "Seer Desk"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1294116939" "Through this gateway thoughts fly quicker than wind. The portal generates additional control for your base."
// DisplayNames :
"P4059867109" "Viewing Portal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1892703543" "Through the Overseer, you can call upon many spirits. Their guidance gives you more control for your base."
// DisplayNames :
"P602728546" "Mystic Overseer"
// DisplayDescription :
"P202096557" "This ominous intelligence has the power to interpret the future for those wise enough to understand its words. By opening a gateway to it, you generate additional control for your base."
// DisplayNames :
"P2480885634" "Astral Haruspex"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1541462773" "The Mission Computer is a nerve center of base communications. It is used to get special missions and trials for your group, including those for the Items of Power."
// DisplayNames :
"P1798812464" "Mission Computer"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2704349541" "The Oracle has the power to grant group missions and trials, including those for the Items of Power."
// DisplayNames :
"P4047896278" "Oracle"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3405434823" "The Aspect of the Pillar allows access to the temporal network of Ouroboros' Pillar of Ice and Flame, allowing you to revisit the past and try your hand at missions you have outleveled."
// DisplayNames :
"P2301863432" "Pillar of Ice and Flame"
