// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Defense 
// DisplayName :
"P337169641" "Defense"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base NPCDefs - Defense 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - Defense 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1433991992" "The Energy Beam Mk I is the inexpensive solution to base defense, readily available to all. It fires a concentrated blast of energy capable of doing moderate damage to low-rank foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P1747893660" "Energy Beam"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3162541619" "The Igniter provides an alternative to standard lethal or energy attacks, diversifying your base defenses. It sprays fire at a single target, causing minor damage over time."
// DisplayNames :
"P3428577005" "Igniter"
// DisplayDescription :
"P929396376" "This is a military-issue automated light sentry turret. It can automatically detect and fire short bursts at infiltrators, making it ideal for installation defense."
// DisplayNames :
"P193312026" "Chain Gun"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4165701602" "The Benedict Industries Dampening Ray is the solution to your threat reduction needs. Using the latest controlled energy burst technology, the Benedict DR combines minor damage with a weakening effect that reduces damage caused by the target for a short duration."
// DisplayNames :
"P3806117826" "Dampening Ray"
// DisplayDescription :
"P852810750" "The Sapper cannon provides the finest in target incapacitation for perimeter defense. Using a focused electrical charge, a single shot drains Endurance from the target. Repeated hits can render even the most powerful foes powerless, unable to activate attacks or defenses."
// DisplayNames :
"P113623609" "Sapper"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3115272759" "Battles are won with good intelligence, and the Battlefield Analyzer provides realtime assessments of potential threats. As it scans targets and analyzes their weaknesses, the device also debuffs their Defense and Resistances."
// DisplayNames :
"P2589124277" "Scanner"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1385789559" "The Cryo Cannon fires a blast of super coolant capable of affecting even the most fiery super. In addition to causing minor damage, the cannon can freeze the target in place for a short period of time."
// DisplayNames :
"P4112678498" "Chill Cannon"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3952752528" "The Energy Beam Mk II is the medium-power solution to base defense. It fires a concentrated blast of energy capable of doing moderate damage to mid-rank foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P2843178103" "Improved Energy Beam"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4081590548" "The Improved Igniter upgrades your alternatives to standard lethal or energy attacks, diversifying your base defenses. It sprays fire at a single target, causing moderate damage over time."
// DisplayNames :
"P1125702020" "Improved Igniter"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1907358717" "This is an automated sentry turret, standard to military bases worldwide. It can automatically detect infiltrators and fires bursts that cause moderate damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P117919672" "Improved Chain Gun"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2210055300" "A refinement of the already popular Benedict Industries Dampening Ray, the Version 2 is a cost effective solution to your threat reduction needs. The Benedict DR2 combines minor damage with a weakening effect that reduces damage caused by the target for a short duration."
// DisplayNames :
"P3186503336" "Improved Dampening Ray"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3660326660" "The Sapper II provides target incapacitation for perimeter defense. Using a focused electrical charge, each shot drains Endurance from the target, rendering foes unable to activate attacks or defenses."
// DisplayNames :
"P543970533" "Improved Sapper"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2293851849" "The Strategic Analyzer provides improved performance in the realtime assessments of potential threats. Scanned targets have their Defense and Resistances debuffed as their weaknesses are analyzed."
// DisplayNames :
"P353489372" "Improved Scanner"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3667525423" "The Improved Cryo Cannon fires a blast of super coolant capable of affecting even the most fiery super. In addition to causing damage, the cannon can freeze the target in place for a short period of time."
// DisplayNames :
"P3258653787" "Improved Chill Cannon"
// DisplayDescription :
"P985184942" "The Energy Beam Mk III is the top-of-the-line in base defense. It fires a concentrated blast of energy capable of doing moderate damage to mid-rank foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P833615517" "Elite Energy Beam"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2814736000" "The Elite Igniter provides an alternative to standard lethal or energy attacks, diversifying your base defenses. It sprays fire at a single target, causing moderate damage over time."
// DisplayNames :
"P3892338626" "Elite Igniter"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1579027926" "This is the deluxe automated sentry turret, standard to military bases worldwide. It can automatically detect and fire heavy machine gun bursts at infiltrators."
// DisplayNames :
"P2784963126" "Elite Chain Gun"
// DisplayDescription :
"P119758277" "Benedict DR3 is the discriminating buyer's solution to threat reduction needs. It combines damage with a bio-tech incapacitating pulse that reduces damage caused by the target for a short duration."
// DisplayNames :
"P449400602" "Elite Dampening Ray"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3541730586" "The Sapper III provides target offense reduction capability for perimeter defense. Using a focused electrical charge, each shot drains Endurance from the target, rendering him powerless to activate attacks or defenses."
// DisplayNames :
"P3923200970" "Elite Sapper"
// DisplayNames :
"P3188283290" "Elite Scanner"
// DisplayDescription :
"P344954702" "The Elite Cryo Cannon fires a blast of supercoolant capable of affecting even the most fiery super. In addition to causing damage, the cannon can freeze the target in place for a short period of time."
// DisplayNames :
"P2189217727" "Elite Chill Cannon"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3370217081" "Based on the latest in research from Black Scorpion's labs, the X-8 Missile Launcher, better known as the Scorpion's Surprise, is one of the heaviest pieces of base defense ordnance available today. It combines heavy damage and stunning blasts into a surprising package that can rise from any floor surface."
// DisplayNames :
"P1591485269" "Scorpion's Surprise"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4029360857" "Developed at a military skunk works, the RPT was built from captured Rikti technology. Only a few prototytpes of the RPT are said to exist, so it is quite an honor for your base to be granted one."
// DisplayNames :
"P1921260478" "Rikti Plasma Turret"
// DisplayDescription :
"P424025657" "Raw energy is surprisingly easy to manipulate, making these pylons a standard defense item."
// DisplayDescription :
"P1079821292" "This crystal taps into the fires of other realms to cause minor damage over time to targets in range."
// DisplayDescription :
"P1675103099" "This item uses a series of spells to summon stone balls and launch them at invaders, causing lethal damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P3110410276" "Stonethrower"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1793617655" "The beam from this crystal weakens enemies, reducing the damage they can cause for a short duration."
// DisplayDescription :
"P1035857378" "This beam taps into the darkness of the netherworld, sucking the very spirit from your enemies and draining Endurance with each hit."
// DisplayDescription :
"P4244213261" "The all-seeing power of this item penetrates the mind of the target, revealing his weaknesses and fears. The target's Defense and Resistances are lowered for a short time."
// DisplayNames :
"P757522803" "Analyzer"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1223972252" "This item brings forth a chilling blast from the elemental realms, capable of causing damage and holding the target for a short time."
// DisplayNames :
"P2861668833" "Snow Crystal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2492032123" "Raw energy is surprisingly easy to manipulate, and the proper spells can enhance its power in battle."
// DisplayDescription :
"P766788834" "This crystal taps into the fires of other realms to cause moderate damage over time to targets in range."
// DisplayNames :
"P2390522397" "Improved Stonethrower"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1320952573" "The beam from this crystal weakens enemies, reducing the damage they can cause for a short time."
// DisplayDescription :
"P1970708207" "This beam taps into the darkness of the netherworld to suck the very spirit from your enemies, draining their Endurance with each hit."
// DisplayDescription :
"P2532096821" "The all-seeing power of this item  penetrates the mind of the target, revealing his weaknesses and fears. The target's Defense and Resistances are lowered for a short time."
// DisplayNames :
"P432503736" "Improved Analyzer"
// DisplayNames :
"P2643000280" "Improved Snow Crystal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2828934" "The spells set upon this crystal allow it to shape raw energy into a potent blast. Only the most powerful arcane master can construct such a weapon successfully."
// DisplayDescription :
"P2052886477" "This artifact taps into infernal fires to scorch your enemies, causing severe damage over time."
// DisplayDescription :
"P2426657057" "This artifact fires capsules of pure force that can strike down a target with lethal damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P3460016633" "Elite Stonethrower"
// DisplayDescription :
"P340093019" "The Eye of Age inflicts the curse of age on the target. Muscles weaken and tire. Damage caused by the target is reduced until the effect wears off."
// DisplayDescription :
"P1737623419" "The Eye of Despair saps the will of enemies, sucking ambition and drive from their very souls. Each hit drains Endurance from the target."
// DisplayNames :
"P2262009755" "Elite Analyzer"
// DisplayNames :
"P3721340988" "Elite Snow Crystal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3800294713" "The Gas Emitter provides a cost-effective non-lethal addition to an integrated base defense.  The system's chemical agents enter the nervous system to impair vision and coordination , reducing the victim's accuracy for a moderate duration."
// DisplayNames :
"P406129846" "Gas Trap"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1034026953" "This is a field-issue M-110 PDM,  a small and virtually undetectable munition designed to discourage and delay pursuers. It is fitted with a sophisticated sensor system programmed to discriminate between friendly and hostile targets. It does moderate damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P3152262469" "Trip mine"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1294151954" "The field emitted by this device inhibits motion of all foes within it. Movement speed and attack rate are reduced while in the area of effect."
// DisplayNames :
"P1883300680" "Slow Field"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4133697143" "The Micro-Emitter Repulsor Field (MERF) combines unobtrusive installation with high-energy repulsion. When activated, the MERF releases a powerful non-damaging charge capable of flinging opponents away."
// DisplayNames :
"P3935752996" "Repulsor"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3250790002" "TESLA-1 is the security professional's preferred solution to non-lethal restraint. Discreet enough to be placed in the finest offices, the TESLA-1 is designed to detect intruders and hold them within a powerful tesla field. When seconds are vital for your security response, count on the TESLA-1!"
// DisplayNames :
"P4277270469" "Tesla Cage"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4070253706" "This trap emits poisonous smoke from an arcane incense. The fumes from this incense blur the victim's senses, reducing his accuracy for a time."
// DisplayDescription :
"P2735107596" "This charm unleashes a powerful blast when an enemy comes to close, dealing heavy lethal damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P1332493140" "Explosive Rune"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1497056211" "This artifact calls on the deities of speed to curse all who enter it. Those in the area of effect have their speed and attack rate reduced."
// DisplayDescription :
"P2641188678" "This small device has been enchanted with a spell of polarity. Any foe who comes close to it will be struck with a powerful repulsion wave that can fling him away from the artifact."
// DisplayDescription :
"P302651696" "This device is charged with an entrapment spell that will automatically trigger when an enemy comes near. If successful, the victim is immobilized in a tesla field for a short time."
// DisplayDescription :
"P3253445373" "Troubled by super-stealthed thieves? This high-tech package can not only note the presence of invisible, stealthed, and otherwise hard-to-detect intruders, it also creates a powerful field that suppresses these powers. This field is non-toxic and certified safe for use in all situations, making it ideal for your access screening needs."
// DisplayNames :
"P200267790" "Stealth Suppression"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2433558221" "When armor plating and resistant materials are not enough to protect your valuable equipment, a High-Energy Force Shield is just the thing. Designed for use in hostile environments and able to withstand full combat conditions, this force shield is the perfect supplement to any defense item."
// DisplayNames :
"P2006157955" "Force Field"
// DisplayDescription :
"P494508785" "The Pain Field is an extreme countermeasure for situations where non-lethal measures are not enough. Pulsing waves of energy cause damage over time to enemies within the radius of the generator, making the Pain Field an ideal area denial and supplemental defense system."
// DisplayNames :
"P1578200966" "Pain Field"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1246484155" "The Weakness Field provides a practical alternative to lethal counter-measures. A combination of sub-sonics and focused energy pulses disrupts bio systems, effectively slowing health and stamina recovery."
// DisplayNames :
"P1033663574" "Weakness Field"
// DisplayDescription :
"P272918711" "This device binds an unsleeping guardian who watches everything within in its radius. All stealth and invisibility powers are negated in the area of effect."
// DisplayDescription :
"P1634772380" "Through a small rift between this dimension and the Shadow Shard, this device summons a shell of energy that protects all within it."
// DisplayDescription :
"P467792609" "This device recreates the insidious pain field used by the Circle of Thorns. Any foe in the area of effect will suffer minor damage over time."
// DisplayDescription :
"P2318005049" "By studying the spells of the Circle of Thorns, arcane masters have created the weakness field. Foes in the area of effect have their health and endurance regeneration reduced."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
