// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - DefenseAux 
// DisplayName :
"P1471925978" "Defense Aux"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - DefenseAux 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3687109790" "The power amplifiers in this auxiliary item increase the damage dealt by any defense it is linked to."
// GroupDescription :
"P1352638839" "DefenseAux"
// DisplayNames :
"P477292051" "Damage Booster"
// DisplayDescription :
"P889186949" "This sensor package improves the targeting accuracy of any defense item linked to it."
// DisplayNames :
"P2602018613" "Targeting Module"
// DisplayDescription :
"P25614415" "This auxiliary item allows you to set a targeting spot for a defense item in the same room. The targeting spot can be anywhere in the room. When a foe enters the spot location, he can be targeted by the linked defense item.  If the linked item is a trap or field, it will activate. If the linked item is a turret it will use its power, if possible. Remember that many powers have limitations of range and line of sight and that closer targets will be fired on first."
// DisplayNames :
"P3301769143" "Sensor Array"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1233392060" "This auxiliary item covers any linked defense item in a protective force field."
// DisplayNames :
"P1373085124" "Energy Shield"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4291020639" "The Crey Relay circuit dramatically reduces cool down time between weapon firings. This reduces the overall recharge time of the item."
// DisplayNames :
"P2633747901" "Relay"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3345340502" "Transformers allow you to more efficiently use the energy supply for turrets, reducing the usage requirements."
// DisplayNames :
"P3771864186" "Transformer"
// DisplayDescription :
"P794997403" "The harmonics of this artifact increase the damage power of the linked defense item."
// DisplayDescription :
"P3490639272" "The keen eye of the eagle imparts an increase in the accuracy of the linked defense item."
// DisplayNames :
"P469631177" "Eagle Eye"
// DisplayDescription :
"P436844366" "This charm allows you to select a targeting point for a defense item in the same room. This point can be set anywhere in the room. When a foe enters the location, he can be targeted by the linked defense item.  If the linked item is a trap or field, it will activate. If the linked item is a turret it will use its power, if possible. Remember that many powers have limitations of range and line of sight and that closer targets will be fired on first."
// DisplayNames :
"P3647213162" "Seeing Crystal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2411210927" "The power radiating from this item cloaks the associated item in a shield of energy, increasing its defense."
// DisplayDescription :
"P2647616351" "The Control Rune gives the associated defense the ability to function independently, improving its recharge time between activations."
// DisplayNames :
"P1166119715" "Control Rune"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3447141433" "Conservators allow you to more efficiently use the energy supply for turrets, reducing the Energy usage requirements."
// DisplayNames :
"P3611668687" "Conservator"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - DefenseAux 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1153522560" "+DMG 15%"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3648238487" "+ACC 15%"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1253993742" "Adds target spot"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3431570110" "+Recharge"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2262842848" "Energy Reduction"
// DisplayName :
"P1066578169" "Auto Repair"
// DisplayHelp :
"P858256428" "The Auto Repair increases the chance that a destroyed turret will be repaired after a base Raid."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1170438563" "Repairs destroyed item"
// DisplayName :
"P466554933" "Resurrector"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3775622214" "The Resurrector increases the chance that a destroyed item will be repaired after a base Raid."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Empowerment 
// DisplayName :
"P3360419001" "Empowerment"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Empowerment 
// DisplayName :
"P2335485245" "Radiation Emulator"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1804046268" "This Empowerment station enables you to make Tier II Salvage, as well as use that Salvage to make long-duration Buffs that can boost your character's effectiveness.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3314588572" "Enables First Order Empowerments"
// DisplayTabName :
"P2665157042" "Tech Empowerment"
// DisplayName :
"P2748301183" "Linear Accelerator"
// DisplayHelp :
"P471424332" "This Empowerment station enables you to make Tier II Salvage, as well as use that Salvage to make long-duration Buffs that can boost your character's effectiveness.  Rent: 200 Prestige"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2835690806" "Enables Second Order Empowerments"
// DisplayName :
"P3212511219" "Supercollider"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2925734848" "Enables Third Order Empowerments"
// DisplayName :
"P1567214467" "Enchanting Crucible"
// DisplayTabName :
"P2254947663" "Arcane Empowerment"
// DisplayName :
"P3103011228" "Arcane Crucible"
// DisplayName :
"P3064003175" "Mystic Crucible"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2277249315" "This Empowerment station enables you to make Tier II Salvage, as well as use that Salvage to make long-duration Buffs that can boost your character's effectiveness.  Rent: 300 Prestige"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Energy 
// DisplayName :
"P2428337319" "Energy"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - Energy 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1575265783" "Use this object to provide a zillion Energy for testing (placing lots of objects, etc.)"
// DisplayNames :
"P2710568109" "TEST POWER UNIT"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2440831291" "The Haddon 1185 is a proven answer to base power needs. Economical to run, load-bank tested, and government-approved for Super Group use, its German engineered motor is smooth running and compact."
// DisplayNames :
"P1048903443" "Basic Generator"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3403742340" "Portacio Industry's LS-3100 dual-shaft gas turbine can be configured for gas or gas/water operation.  Backed by Portacio's warranty and service network, the LS-3100 is the easy-to-maintain solution to base power needs."
// DisplayNames :
"P506191674" "Turbine Generator"
// DisplayDescription :
"P820463862" "Developed from prototypes found in Dr. Anguish's secret lab, the X3 Fusion is the best power solution money can by. Only the most noteworthy groups have one of these in their base!"
// DisplayNames :
"P42489518" "Fusion Generator"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3887092434" "These power crystals are a common tool of supernatural types. Each generates sufficient power to provide for the needs of a small base."
// DisplayNames :
"P1318550064" "Power Crystal"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4193283647" "Through spells and constructs, mystic power is drawn directly from the earth to provide for base needs. A single tap is usually sufficient for a medium base."
// DisplayNames :
"P1431887532" "Ley Tap"
// DisplayDescription :
"P697729807" "Impressive bases require immense power. The dimensional vortex opens a gateway to a realm of pure energy which can be carefully tapped to accommodate your base needs."
// DisplayNames :
"P1787861383" "Dimensional Vortex"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Energy 
// DisplayTabName :
"P470561417" "Tech Energy"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P668139437" "Energy Production: {Energy}"
// DisplayTabName :
"P2993004225" "Arcane Energy"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - EnergyAux 
// DisplayName :
"P3498774609" "Energy Aux"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - EnergyAux 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3931828184" "By providing improved failsafes, the Rook Industries Circuit Breaker increases power output from all generator models."
// GroupDescription :
"P1759705318" "EnergyAux"
// DisplayNames :
"P4163977163" "Circuit Breaker"
// DisplayDescription :
"P534182754" "The Rook Power Shielding provides extra protection for base generator components. When activated it cloaks the unit in a protective force field."
// DisplayNames :
"P4264836857" "Generator Energy Curtain"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2170456493" "The binding spells of this Crystal Focus increase the power output of energy devices."
// DisplayNames :
"P3234100682" "Crystal Focus"
// DisplayDescription :
"P857140280" "The circle of protection is a standard part of any mystic's repertoire. This one is meant to contain and protect the power within."
// DisplayNames :
"P2854291768" "Crystal Ward"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - EnergyAux 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P5693990" "Increases Energy output"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P841627243" "Increases defense"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - EnergyControl 
// DisplayName :
"P2916030754" "Start Up"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - EnergyControl 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2749629769" "A small generator and laptop computer. Just enough power and control to get a small base up and running."
// GroupDescription :
"P2308774028" "EnergyControl"
// DisplayNames :
"P3448525879" "Combo Power and Control Unit"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - EnergyControl 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2294036992" "Generates {Control} Control and {Energy} Energy"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Entrance 
// DisplayName :
"P2125202399" "Entrance"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Entrance 
// DisplayName :
"P2086634654" "Secret Entrance"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1067264696" "This is the main entrance of the base. If you entered by the main entrance, it will take you back to where you were."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1005213019" "Main Entrance"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - ItemsOfPower 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - ItemsOfPower 
// DisplayName :
"P3911788277" "Item of Power Base"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3908595461" "Because of their massive energies and strange properties, special bases are needed to display an Item of Power."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2900459478" "Special bases are needed to display an item of power"
// DisplayName :
"P3028481180" "The One Book of Rularuu"
// DisplayHelp :
"P137727993" "This book is said to contain the essence of the timelines that have been, are, and could be. The full meaning is beyond the comprehension of all but Rularuu, but even the tiniest fragment of the text bestows power upon those who possess it. The One Book gives a 50%% reduction to debt incurred by all Super Group members at all times."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P953778303" "50% debt reduction"
// DisplayName :
"P3195497801" "The True Furnace"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1658926217" "This is the True Furnace Rularuu used to construct his inter-dimensional factory cubes. Although it cannot be harnessed, the True Furnace radiates energy, increasing the Endurance of every Supergroup member and supplying power to all items in a base."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2301280604" "+Max End"
// DisplayName :
"P462705142" "Daralak's Heart"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3665251977" "Not all Rularuu's treasures have physical form. Hovering here is the Heart of Daralak, a mighty brute. The Heart increases the health of all members of a Super Group."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2186260285" "+Max HP"
// DisplayName :
"P334556905" "Anger Monument"
// DisplayHelp :
"P914387179" "Carved with strange glyphs that scholars have yet to decipher, the Anger Monument radiates with evil power. When this is in your base, it gives all members a small bonus to damage. You can have up to 5 copies in your base."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3937184860" "Enhances Damage"
// DisplayName :
"P2354559707" "Torment Monument"
// DisplayHelp :
"P495780991" "Said to be empowered by the pain and suffering of Rularuu's victims, this stone perversely allows Super Group members to repay debt quicker. You may have up to 5 copies of this item."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1800807434" "Debt Repayment"
// DisplayName :
"P2857996439" "Monument of Iron"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4256895909" "Harder than diamond, the Monument of Iron confers a slight resistance to certain mind-affecting powers. You can have up to 5 copies of this item."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2388627655" "Resist(Hold, Sleep, Immob, Stun)"
// DisplayName :
"P1744438895" "Fury Monument"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3555663300" "This item of power has been imbued with the fury of Rularuu's ambition. This power actually gives a small bonus to experience earned for all Supergroup members. You can have up to 5 copies of this item."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3528521403" "+XP"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Medical 
// DisplayName :
"P3093708486" "Medical"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - Medical 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1010072297" "The reclamator works like those at the hospitals, teleporting defeated members to the base and automatically healing them. Its healing is less efficient than a hospital's, but can be improved with auxiliary items."
// DisplayNames :
"P1396476837" "Basic Reclaimator"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1441251038" "This semi-intelligent robot can help you prepare for battle. It sells health and Endurance Inspirations, and allows you to trade in extra Inspirations for Influence.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayNames :
"P2793494696" "Auto-Doc"
// DisplayDescription :
"P4000216247" "The combat logs record past battles and help you prepare for ones to come. Here you can get Break Free Inspirations.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayNames :
"P912900406" "Combat Logs"
// DisplayDescription :
"P2988730612" "The healing altar works similar to a hospital, teleporting defeated members to the altar and automatically healing them. Its healing is less efficient than a hospital's, but can be improved with auxiliary items."
// DisplayNames :
"P13339604" "Resurrection Circle"
// DisplayDescription :
"P1528608519" "The Tree of Wonders produces Inspirations that can be used by Super Group members, for a cost. You can also feed it with unneeded Inspirations to get Influence.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayNames :
"P485113006" "Tree of Wonders"
// DisplayDescription :
"P750768066" "These contemplation charts will help prepare you for the worst kinds of combat situations. Here you can get Break Free Inspirations.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayNames :
"P4161135094" "Contemplation Charts"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Medical 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3328102662" "Heals HP and End by {FunctionPercent}%"
// DisplayTabName :
"P1681687111" "Tech Medical"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3672072953" "Buys and sells Inspirations"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P672128559" "Sells anti-mez Inspirations"
// DisplayTabName :
"P479535689" "Arcane Medical"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - MedicalAux 
// DisplayName :
"P2004250039" "Medical Aux"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - MedicalAux 
// DisplayDescription :
"P52144466" "The Robosurgery's molecular level controls allow for precise surgical repair of injuries. It will increase your reclamator's healing abilities by {FunctionPercent}%.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// GroupDescription :
"P4072242946" "MedicalAux"
// DisplayNames :
"P1258243543" "Robo-Surgery"
// DisplayDescription :
"P775134106" "The Rune Spire channels healing energies, improving an altar's healing effectiveness by {FunctionPercent}%.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayNames :
"P2472460728" "Spirit Signal"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - MedicalAux 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P877367103" "Reclamator Auxilliary"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3290578281" "Resurrection Circle Auxilliary"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Storage 
// DisplayName :
"P2613519016" "Storage"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - Storage 
// DisplayDescription :
"P32071997" "An access point to your personal storage for Invention Salvage."
// DisplayNames :
"P2426825550" "Personal Storage Vault"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Storage 
// DisplayName :
"P4127144299" "Fake Storage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3655611080" "Fake Item"
// DisplayName :
"P3664866856" "Test Shelf"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2074164441" "This Item should have two stackable surfaces: one on the top of the shelf, and on one on the bottom (the floor under the shelf)."
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3525181076" "Stacking Test Item"
// DisplayName :
"P3980445442" "Test Shelf Inspirations"
// DisplayName :
"P1250664572" "Test Shelf Enhancements"
// DisplayName :
"P1983310157" "Enhancement Table"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3607253799" "Tired of having a limited inventory for Enhancements? This table breaks down and stores Enhancments gathered by your Supergroup. Each unit can hold up to 100 enhancements.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P4122744638" "Stores Enhancements"
// DisplayTabName :
"P4168780184" "Tech Workshop"
// DisplayName :
"P580091157" "Salvage Racks"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2368142280" "With all that new salvage, you need a place to put it. This Stor-It-All system allows you to create a flexible storage solution for your base needs. Each unit can hold up to 30 invention salvage items.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2532329683" "Stores Salvage"
// DisplayName :
"P1563300771" "Inspiration Collector"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3544021379" "Inspirations, the intangible buffs that help you out in combat, can be placed in here for others to bask in your glory, giving them a boost that was destined for you. Each unit can hold 50 Inspirations.  Rent: 100 Prestige"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1383559232" "Stores Inspirations"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1427762309" "Stores Invention Salvage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2964084135" "Tired of having a limited inventory for Enhancements? This table breaks down and stores Enhancments gathered by your Supergroup. Each unit can hold up to 100 enhancements."
// DisplayTabName :
"P532286783" "Arcane Workshop"
// DisplayName :
"P1301522904" "Salvage Storage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2241051987" "With all that new salvage, you need a place to put it. This Stor-It-All system allows you to create a flexible storage solution for your base needs. Each unit can hold up to 30 invention salvage items."
// DisplayName :
"P4102089327" "Inspiration Storage"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3096281845" "Inspirations, the intangible buffs that help you out in combat, can be placed in here for others to bask in your glory, giving them a boost that was destined for you. Each unit can store 50 Inspirations."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Item Category - Teleport 
// DisplayName :
"P569504987" "Teleport"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Base VillainDefs - Teleport 
// DisplayDescription :
"P669095491" "This standard telepad has been wired into the teleportation network. To function, you must have a zone beacon to the target zone. Your SG can unlock these beacons by finding the exploration badges in the desired zone."
// DisplayNames :
"P178905021" "Basic Telepad"
// DisplayDescription :
"P947691364" "This specially Hacked Telepad has been wired into the teleportation network and can connect to more Beacons than a Basic Telepad. To function, you must have a zone beacon to the target zone. Your SG can unlock these beacons by finding the exploration badges in the desired zone."
// DisplayNames :
"P778115154" "Hacked Telepad"
// DisplayDescription :
"P274636774" "This specially Magicked Telepad has been wired into the teleportation network and can connect to more Beacons than a Basic Telepad. To function, you must have a zone beacon to the target zone. Your SG can unlock these beacons by finding the exploration badges in the desired zone."
// DisplayNames :
"P241377067" "Magicked Telepad"
// DisplayDescription :
"P840734850" "This telepad allows a team to teleport to a Base Raid or an Item of Power Trial. All members of the same team will go to the same location... but characters on different teams may end up scattered all over!"
// DisplayNames :
"P1385533319" "Raid Telepad"
// DisplayDescription :
"P3596499676" "This teleportal allows a team to teleport to a Base Raid or an Item of Power Trial. All members of the same team will go to the same location... but characters on different teams may end up scattered all over!"
// DisplayNames :
"P2250061361" "Raid Teleportal"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
